{"id": "19c66e1a-109f-41ef-a994-0e76884100a4", "slug": "nebulaops-deploy-with-clarity", "title": "NebulaOps - Deploy with clarity", "description": "Nebulaops Deploy Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NebulaOps - Deploy with clarity\"\ndescription: \"Nebulaops Deploy Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#8B5CF6\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NebulaOps - Deploy with clarity\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 2; favorites: 4; remixes: 2.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nNebulaops Deploy Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNebulaOps Platform Solutions Company Get started Next-Gen Infrastructure Orchestration Deploy with absolute clarity. Streamline complex deployments. Eliminate configuration drift. Unify your entire stack. NebulaOps brid…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Deploy with absolute clarity..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8B5CF6, secondary #050505, accent #8B5CF6, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NebulaOps - Deploy with clarity</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden antialiased relative selection:bg-violet-500/30\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Animation Canvas -->\n    <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Gradient Overlay to fade canvas at the top -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#050505] via-[#050505]/80 to-transparent z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Floating Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full px-4 sm:px-6 pt-6 flex justify-center sticky top-0\">\n            <nav class=\"bg-white rounded-full w-full max-w-6xl flex items-center justify-between px-2 py-2 pr-2 pl-4 sm:pl-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-gray-100/20 backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300\">\n\n                <!-- Logo -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-400 via-violet-500 to-rose-500 p-[2px] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-180\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-900 font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg font-geist\">NebulaOps</span>\n                </a>\n\n                <!-- Desktop Nav Links -->\n                <ul class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-geist\">Platform</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-geist\">Solutions</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors font-geist\">Company</a></li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <!-- CTA & Mobile Toggle -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-500/25 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 font-geist\">\n                        Get started\n                    </a>\n                    <button class=\"md:hidden flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 text-gray-600 rounded-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 text-center pt-20 pb-32\">\n\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center\">\n                <!-- Eyebrow -->\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 mb-8 backdrop-blur-md animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-violet-400 to-rose-400 font-geist\">\n                        Next-Gen Infrastructure Orchestration\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Headline -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5rem] text-white mb-8 leading-[1.1] font-geist tracking-tight font-light\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.2s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    Deploy with <br class=\"hidden sm:block\"> absolute clarity.\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subheadline -->\n                <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 font-geist\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.4s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    Streamline complex deployments. Eliminate configuration drift. Unify your entire stack. NebulaOps bridges the divide and accelerates your delivery—reliably, every time.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Action Buttons (Mobile fallback for CTA) -->\n                <div class=\"flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center w-full\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.6s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full max-w-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 text-white px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 font-geist\">\n                        Get started now\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        @keyframes fadeInUp {\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n        let rays = [];\n\n        const colors = [\n            { r: 52, g: 211, b: 153 },  // Emerald\n            { r: 139, g: 92, b: 246 },  // Violet\n            { r: 244, g: 63, b: 94 }    // Rose\n        ];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            initRays();\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.reset();\n            }\n\n            reset() {\n                this.x = width / 2 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * (width * 0.8);\n                this.y = height + Math.random() * 200;\n                this.size = Math.random() * 2 + 0.5;\n                this.speedY = -(Math.random() * 1 + 0.5);\n\n                // Determine color based on X position relative to width\n                const normalizedX = this.x / width;\n                let c1, c2, ratio;\n                if (normalizedX < 0.5) {\n                    c1 = colors[0];\n                    c2 = colors[1];\n                    ratio = normalizedX * 2;\n                } else {\n                    c1 = colors[1];\n                    c2 = colors[2];\n                    ratio = (normalizedX - 0.5) * 2;\n                }\n\n                this.r = Math.floor(c1.r + (c2.r - c1.r) * ratio);\n                this.g = Math.floor(c1.g + (c2.g - c1.g) * ratio);\n                this.b = Math.floor(c1.b + (c2.b - c1.b) * ratio);\n\n                this.alpha = 0;\n                this.targetAlpha = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.2;\n                this.life = 0;\n                this.maxLife = Math.random() * 300 + 100;\n            }\n\n            update() {\n                this.y += this.speedY;\n                // Drift towards center slightly\n                this.x += (width/2 - this.x) * 0.001;\n\n                this.life++;\n                if (this.life < 50) {\n                    this.alpha += (this.targetAlpha - this.alpha) * 0.1;\n                } else if (this.life > this.maxLife - 50) {\n                    this.alpha -= this.alpha * 0.1;\n                }\n\n                if (this.y < height * 0.2 || this.life >= this.maxLife || this.alpha < 0.01) {\n                    this.reset();\n                }\n            }\n\n            draw() {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${this.r}, ${this.g}, ${this.b}, ${this.alpha})`;\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initRays() {\n            rays = [];\n            const numRays = 12;\n            const originX = width / 2;\n            const originY = height + 100;\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < numRays; i++) {\n                const angle = (Math.PI / numRays) * i + (Math.PI); // Half circle upwards\n                rays.push({\n                    angle: angle,\n                    baseAlpha: Math.random() * 0.15 + 0.05,\n                    pulseSpeed: Math.random() * 0.02 + 0.01,\n                    pulsePhase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function drawRays(time) {\n            const originX = width / 2;\n            const originY = height + 100;\n            const rayLength = height * 1.5;\n\n            rays.forEach((ray, i) => {\n                const currentAlpha = ray.baseAlpha + Math.sin(time * ray.pulseSpeed + ray.pulsePhase) * 0.05;\n\n                // Color interpolation based on angle\n                const normalizedAngle = i / (rays.length - 1);\n                let c1, c2, ratio;\n                if (normalizedAngle < 0.5) {\n                    c1 = colors[0]; c2 = colors[1]; ratio = normalizedAngle * 2;\n                } else {\n                    c1 = colors[1]; c2 = colors[2]; ratio = (normalizedAngle - 0.5) * 2;\n                }\n                const r = Math.floor(c1.r + (c2.r - c1.r) * ratio);\n                const g = Math.floor(c1.g + (c2.g - c1.g) * ratio);\n                const b = Math.floor(c1.b + (c2.b - c1.b) * ratio);\n\n                const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(originX, originY, originX + Math.cos(ray.angle) * rayLength, originY + Math.sin(ray.angle) * rayLength);\n                grad.addColorStop(0, `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, ${Math.max(0, currentAlpha)})`);\n                grad.addColorStop(1, `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, 0)`);\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(originX, originY);\n                ctx.lineTo(originX + Math.cos(ray.angle - 0.1) * rayLength, originY + Math.sin(ray.angle - 0.1) * rayLength);\n                ctx.lineTo(originX + Math.cos(ray.angle + 0.1) * rayLength, originY + Math.sin(ray.angle + 0.1) * rayLength);\n                ctx.closePath();\n                ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n                ctx.fill();\n            });\n        }\n\n        function init() {\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) particles.push(new Particle());\n            animate(0);\n        }\n\n        function animate(time) {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            // Draw gradient background glow at bottom\n            const bgGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(width/2, height, 0, width/2, height, height*0.8);\n            bgGrad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15)');\n            bgGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(5, 5, 5, 0)');\n            ctx.fillStyle = bgGrad;\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            drawRays(time);\n\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                p.update();\n                p.draw();\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        init();\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nebulaops-deploy-with-clarity.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nebulaops-deploy-with-clarity.jpg", "source_name": "nebulaops-deploy-with-clarity-DESIGN.md", "views": 60, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:37:38.128498+00:00"}